<view class="content-shell">
  <text></text>
  <view class="business-hero">
    <text></text>
    <view>
      <text>一键冒烟运行</text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
    <view>
      <text>生成或转换完成的项目会自带 Batch 46 冒烟包。在这里选中项目即可一键跑起来：
          自动灌入一次性种子数据、探活、跑冒烟断言，免费额度到期后自动停止服务并清空临时数据。</text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
  </view>
  <text></text>
  <view class="business-form">
    <text></text>
    <text class="business-form-grid">
      <text></text>
      <text>
        <text>项目引用（相对 ELMOS_SMOKE_PROJECTS_ROOT 的路径）</text>
      </text>
      <text></text>
      <input value="{{draft}}" placeholder="例如 java-to-python/orders-service" maxLength="{{180}}" bindchange="(event) => setDraft(event.target.value)" />
      <text></text>
    </text>
    <text></text>
    <view class="business-actions">
      <text></text>
      <button type="button" class="button button-primary" disabled="{{!valid}}" bindtap="() => setProjectRef(draft.trim())">
        <text>载入冒烟包</text>
      </button>
      <text></text>
    </view>
    <text></text>
  </view>
  <text></text>
  <SmokeRunButton wx:if="{{projectRef}}" key="{{projectRef}}" projectRef="{{projectRef}}" />
  <view wx:else />
  <text></text>
</view>
